# Internal planning documents.
#
# docs/plans/ is where the agent workflow tells Claude to write plans, and those
# are meant to ship alongside the code they describe. But a plan written about
# this repository's own development can carry internal ticket IDs and links,
# and this repository is public. One `git add -A` published one by accident.
#
# Ignore them here and commit deliberately with `git add -f` when a plan is
# genuinely meant to be public.
docs/plans/
